			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730310101,
					"content": "蘭拉迦、蘭羅摩，我們回來啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310102,
					"content": "#又見到那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙了！真開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310103,
					"content": "#哎呀，{F#妳}{M#你}們回來了。大家都在說，有個好高大、好厲害的那菈{NICKNAME}，幫了他們很多很多。大家都很開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭拉迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310104,
					"content": "#有人幫忙幹活確實很開心呢！對吧，{NICKNAME}？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310105,
						730310106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310105,
					"content": "真開心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730310107,
					"content": "不是的。他們開心，是因為認識了新朋友。雖然蘭納真、蘭納迦和蘭迦魯都不記得了，但森林會記住一切。故事不會徹底失落。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭拉迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310108,
					"content": "噢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310109,
					"content": "無憂節的準備，應該差不多要好了。還要準備一段時間！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310110,
					"content": "#嗯，多虧了那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙幫忙。無憂節終於快要開始了。真期待呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭拉迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310106,
					"content": "哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310107
					]
				}
			]
		},
