					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310309,
					"content": "無憂節的準備，應該差不多要好了。我好期待！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310310,
						730310311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310310,
					"content": "不知道拉娜的情況如何了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310315
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730310315,
					"content": "#嗯，我們去看看拉娜吧，{NICKNAME}。說不定有所好轉了呢！哎呀，那我們就能把她帶來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310316,
						730310317,
						730310318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310316,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730310320,
					"content": "嗯。一會我也會去找蘭拉娜。你們先去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310321,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}、派蒙，我們一會見！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310317,
					"content": "希望如此吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730310318,
					"content": "不抱太大期望…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730310319,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310311,
					"content": "我也很期待。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730310312,
					"content": "嗯！不知道和別的地方的節日相比，是什麼樣的感覺呢？能和朋友們一起過節，好興奮喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310313,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310314,
					"content": "…如果拉娜也在就好了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730310306,
					"content": "喔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730310307
					]
				}
			]
		},
